# Snatcher (US Sega CD) Act 1: title -> lobby -> Chief's office (Junker ID) -> Engineering -> Detective's Room -> Computer Room -> Shooting Range -> Harry (Metal Gear, blaster) -> Turbocycle -> factory ruins -> inside the factory -> Gibson -> the cave-in -> the bomb in Little John.
at 3400:3:START            # title: Start opens OPTIONS
at 3600:3:DOWN
at 3640:3:DOWN
at 3680:3:DOWN             # QUIT (GUN ADJUST is skipped without a gun)
at 3800:3:C                # new game
every 4400:28000:120:6:C   # opening text; the intro cinematic runs to about frame 31500
at 32100:4:C               # Mika's greeting
at 32400:4:C               # lobby ENTER (first time): Mika asks for ID, TALK appears
every 32700:34000:150:4:C  # her questions
at 34200:3:UP              # lobby cursor ENTER -> TALK (wraps)
at 34350:4:C               # TALK: close-up of Mika; its menu is ready by 35400
clock 35500                # close-up menu LOOK / INVESTIGATE / TALK / ASK, cursor LOOK
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN         # ASK
sel
nav DOWN DOWN              # ABOUT MIKA (1st: 4 pages)
sel
text 4
sel                        # cursor stays on ASK
nav DOWN DOWN              # ABOUT MIKA (2nd: 2 pages)
sel
text 2
sel
sel                        # ABOUT JUNKERS (3 pages): ENTER now heads the menu, cursor index 3 = TALK
text 3
nav UP UP UP               # ENTER
sel
text 8                     # Mika opens the doors; the 6th tap picks CHIEF'S OFFICE on her tour menu
text 8                     # the Chief's voiced briefing (portraits, no text pages)
text 2                     # his menu EXIT / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / ASK is up by about frame 44275, cursor EXIT
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN         # ASK
sel
wait 200
sel                        # ABOUT JUNKERS (2 pages)
text 2
sel                        # ASK
wait 200
nav DOWN                   # ABOUT JUNKER AUTHORITY (7 pages)
sel
text 7
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN              # ABOUT JUNKER DUTIES (2 pages)
sel
text 2
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN         # ABOUT JUNKER STAFF (2 pages)
sel
text 2
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN    # ABOUT SNATCHERS (3 pages)
sel
text 2
text 10                    # page 3, then the voiced ID card scene; POSSESSIONS joins the menu, cursor stays on ASK
wait 400                   # the menu is drawn before it takes input (voice still playing)
sel                        # ASK
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN   # ABOUT NAVIGATORS (1 page)
sel
text 1
wait 200
nav UP UP UP               # EXIT
sel
text 1                     # Mika: where next?
nav DOWN                   # ENGINEERING ROOM
sel
text 2                     # Engineering: Harry is out; menu EXIT / LOOK / ASK / POSSESSIONS, cursor EXIT
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN              # ASK (cursor stays on ASK afterwards)
sel
wait 200
sel                        # ABOUT HARRY (1st)
text 1
wait 200
sel
wait 200
sel                        # ABOUT HARRY (2nd)
text 1
wait 200
sel
wait 200
sel                        # ABOUT HARRY (3rd)
text 1
wait 200
sel
wait 200
sel                        # ABOUT HARRY (4th; later asks repeat)
text 1
wait 200
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN
sel                        # ABOUT NAVIGATORS
text 1
wait 200
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # ABOUT GIBSON (adds ABOUT KATRINA)
text 2
wait 200
sel
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # ABOUT KATRINA
text 1
wait 200
nav UP UP                  # EXIT
sel
text 1                     # Mika: where next?
nav DOWN DOWN              # DETECTIVE'S ROOM
sel
text 3                     # Detective's room tour; menu EXIT / LOOK / ASK / POSSESSIONS, cursor EXIT

# Detective's Room -> Computer Room -> Shooting Range -> Engineering, where Harry is back
# (going straight back to Engineering only gets "Harry's not back yet").
wait 200
sel                        # EXIT
text 1                     # where next? (tour cursor back on CHIEF'S OFFICE)
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN         # COMPUTER ROOM
sel
text 2                     # computer room intro; menu EXIT / LOOK / ASK / POSSESSIONS
wait 200
sel                        # EXIT
text 1
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN    # SHOOTING RANGE
sel
text 1                     # range intro; menu EXIT / LOOK / ASK / PRACTICE / POSSESSIONS
wait 200
sel                        # EXIT
text 1
nav DOWN                   # ENGINEERING ROOM
sel
text 6                     # Harry's back: 2 pages, then his scene; menu LOOK / INVESTIGATE / ASK / POSSESSIONS

# Harry: ASK ABOUT NAVIGATORS. He fetches Metal Gear (a portrait cutscene with no text box: 15 taps keep the
# probed timing), the menu returns on ASK, and the topic becomes ABOUT METAL GEAR.
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN              # ASK (menu LOOK / INVESTIGATE / ASK / POSSESSIONS)
sel
sel                        # ABOUT NAVIGATORS
tap 15                     # Metal Gear cutscene
tap 1                      # ASK
tap 1                      # ABOUT METAL GEAR
text 12                    # its features: save, light, videophone; menu back on ASK
sel                        # ASK
nav DOWN
sel                        # ABOUT BLASTER
text 12                    # Harry hands over the blaster (cutscene, no text box); menu back on ASK
sel                        # ASK
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # ABOUT SNATCHERS
text 6
# Event, no input needed: a videophone call on Metal Gear, then Gillian outside by the Turbocycle.
clock 90000                # menu ENTER TURBOCYCLE / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / USE METAL GEAR, cursor on ENTER

# Turbocycle to the factory ruins.
sel                        # ENTER TURBOCYCLE
text 1                     # Metal Gear: where to? Menu EXIT TURBOCYCLE / FACTORY RUINS / GILLIAN'S HOME (EXIT refuses)
nav DOWN
sel                        # FACTORY RUINS
tap 12                     # drive cutscene, then the arrival page; menu EXIT TURBOCYCLE / JUNKER HQ / GILLIAN'S HOME
tap 1                      # EXIT TURBOCYCLE: the abandoned factory
text 3                     # arrival page (taps land while it types); menu ENTER TURBOCYCLE / LOOK / INVESTIGATE /
                           # POSSESSIONS / USE METAL GEAR, cursor ENTER (which only gets Gillian wanting to go home)

# Factory exterior: LOOK and INVESTIGATE everything, then the videophone twice; a scream opens ENTER.
nav DOWN
sel                        # LOOK
sel                        # BUILDING
text 1
wait 200
sel                        # LOOK
nav DOWN
sel                        # SKY
text 1
wait 200
sel                        # LOOK
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # AREA
text 1
wait 200
nav DOWN
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
sel                        # BUILDING
text 1
wait 200
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN
sel                        # AREA
text 1
wait 200
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # MOTION DETECTOR
text 2
wait 200
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # USE METAL GEAR
sel                        # VIDEOPHONE
text 5
tap 1                      # USE METAL GEAR (cursor stayed there)
tap 1                      # VIDEOPHONE again
tap 4                      # 4 different pages this time
text 9                     # a scream: voice and portraits, no text box; menu ENTER / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / POSSESSIONS /
                           # USE METAL GEAR, cursor still on USE METAL GEAR

# Into the factory.
wait 200
nav UP UP UP UP            # ENTER
sel                        # ENTER
tap 8                      # 3 pages (going in; A draws the blaster; save often), the way in, 2 pages inside;
                           # menu MOVE / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / LISTEN / POSSESSIONS / USE METAL GEAR
tap 1                      # MOVE (ADVANCE / EXIT)
tap 1                      # ADVANCE
tap 4                      # 1 page, then the next room (rubble, a figure) with portraits and no text box
wait 220                   # menu MOVE ... USE METAL GEAR, cursor MOVE; MOVE offers ADVANCE / RETREAT

# Deeper into the factory: two more rooms, then the figure on the floor.
sel                        # MOVE (ADVANCE / RETREAT)
tap 7                      # ADVANCE: 2 pages, the next room; MOVE, ADVANCE: 1 page, then a figure on the floor
wait 220                   # menu MOVE / LOOK / LISTEN / POSSESSIONS / USE METAL GEAR (no INVESTIGATE yet)
nav DOWN
sel                        # LOOK (BODY / GROUND)
tap 1                      # BODY
tap 4                      # close-up (no text box), 2 pages
wait 220                   # menu gains INVESTIGATE; cursor on LOOK
nav DOWN
sel                        # INVESTIGATE (GIBSON / MOTION DETECTOR; GIBSON opens CORPSE / CLOTHING)
tap 30                     # GIBSON>CORPSE 3 pages, again 1 (RIGHT HAND appears), a third time a portrait scene
                           # (6 taps, INVESTIGATE gains ORGANIC COMPOUNDS), a fourth 1 (CORPSE drops out);
                           # GIBSON>CLOTHING 1 (KEY), again 1 (SCRAP OF PAPER)
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE; list GIBSON / ORGANIC COMPOUNDS / KEY / SCRAP OF PAPER / MOTION DETECTOR
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
sel                        # GIBSON (CLOTHING / RIGHT HAND)
nav DOWN
sel                        # RIGHT HAND
tap 2                      # 2 pages; INVESTIGATE gains HAIR and SKIN SAMPLE
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE; list GIBSON / HAIR / SKIN SAMPLE / ORGANIC COMPOUNDS / KEY /
                           # SCRAP OF PAPER / MOTION DETECTOR
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # ORGANIC COMPOUNDS
tap 8                      # analysis on Metal Gear's screen (no text box)
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN
sel                        # HAIR
tap 13                     # analysis (no text box)
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # SKIN SAMPLE
tap 13                     # analysis (no text box), then 1 page
wait 220
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # KEY
tap 1
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # USE METAL GEAR (VIDEOPHONE / SAVE / REPORT ANALYSIS RESULTS)
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # REPORT ANALYSIS RESULTS (HAIR / SKIN STRUCTURE / ORGANIC COMPOUNDS)
sel                        # HAIR
tap 2
wait 220                   # menu, cursor USE METAL GEAR
sel
nav DOWN DOWN
sel
nav DOWN
sel                        # SKIN STRUCTURE
tap 2
wait 220
sel
nav DOWN DOWN
sel
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # ORGANIC COMPOUNDS
tap 3
wait 220                   # menu, cursor USE METAL GEAR

# Back to Little John: RETREAT twice to the rubble room.
nav DOWN                   # MOVE (the cursor wraps from USE METAL GEAR)
sel
nav DOWN
sel                        # RETREAT
tap 1                      # 1 page; the pipe room
wait 220
sel                        # MOVE
nav DOWN
sel                        # RETREAT
tap 1                      # 1 page; the rubble room
wait 220
nav DOWN
sel                        # LOOK
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # LITTLE JOHN
tap 1                      # close-up, 1 page
wait 220                   # menu, cursor LOOK
nav DOWN
sel                        # INVESTIGATE (CEILING / GROUND / AREA / LITTLE JOHN / MOTION DETECTOR)
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # LITTLE JOHN
tap 4                      # 4 pages: his memory may be intact; adds MEMORY CHIP
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # MEMORY CHIP
tap 3                      # Metal Gear takes the chip (no text box)
wait 220                   # menu, cursor INVESTIGATE

# Forward again to Gibson: Metal Gear now suggests searching his belongings.
nav UP UP
sel                        # MOVE
tap 7                      # ADVANCE, 1 page, the pipe room; MOVE, ADVANCE, 1 page, then 2 pages
wait 220                   # menu MOVE / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / LISTEN / POSSESSIONS / USE METAL GEAR, cursor MOVE

# Gibson's belongings: LOOK GROUND, BLASTER and KEY, then INVESTIGATE and LOOK the scrap of paper.
nav DOWN
sel                        # LOOK (CORPSE / GROUND / KEY / SCRAP OF PAPER)
nav DOWN
sel                        # GROUND
tap 1                      # adds BLASTER
wait 220
sel
nav DOWN DOWN
sel                        # BLASTER
tap 3
wait 220
sel
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # KEY: Metal Gear stores it
tap 3
wait 220
nav DOWN
sel                        # INVESTIGATE
nav UP UP                  # wraps to SCRAP OF PAPER (second from the bottom)
sel
tap 1
wait 220
nav UP
sel                        # LOOK (CORPSE / GROUND / BLASTER / SCRAP OF PAPER)
nav UP                     # wraps to SCRAP OF PAPER
sel
tap 7                      # 3 pages (Metal Gear stores the note), then something runs across a doorway
wait 220                   # menu, cursor LOOK

# The dead end: the Snatchers have vanished behind a cave-in.
nav UP
sel                        # MOVE
tap 4                      # ADVANCE, 1 page, then 2 at the dead end; menu LOOK / INVESTIGATE / LISTEN / POSSESSIONS /
                           # USE METAL GEAR (no MOVE)
tap 1                      # LOOK (FRONT)
tap 1                      # FRONT
tap 1                      # 1 page: blocked by a cave-in
wait 220                   # menu, cursor LOOK; INVESTIGATE offers FRONT / DIRT AND SAND
nav DOWN
sel                        # INVESTIGATE (FRONT / DIRT AND SAND / MOTION DETECTOR)
nav DOWN
sel                        # DIRT AND SAND
tap 17                     # 3 pages (adds EXIT); INVESTIGATE > FRONT twice (1 each); then Metal Gear picks up a
                           # faint sound (several pages)
wait 220                   # menu RETREAT / LOOK / INVESTIGATE / LISTEN / POSSESSIONS / USE METAL GEAR, cursor LOOK
nav UP
sel                        # RETREAT
tap 4                      # 1 page, then 3 in Gibson's corridor (Metal Gear hears a faint sound)
wait 220                   # menu, cursor MOVE
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # LISTEN
tap 1                      # a sound like a timer
wait 220
nav UP UP UP
sel                        # MOVE
nav DOWN
sel                        # RETREAT
tap 4                      # 1 page, then 3 in the pipe room
wait 220                   # menu, cursor MOVE
sel                        # MOVE
nav DOWN
sel                        # RETREAT
tap 6                      # 1 page, then 5 in the rubble room: the sound comes from Little John
wait 220                   # menu, cursor MOVE
nav DOWN
sel                        # LOOK (CEILING / GROUND / AREA / LITTLE JOHN)
nav DOWN DOWN DOWN
sel                        # LITTLE JOHN: the time bomb
tap 5                      # bomb cutscene (2 taps), then pages: save often; Gillian hasn't saved yet
wait 220                   # menu, cursor LOOK. Next: MOVE > RETREAT starts the first shooting scene.
